      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORQUE IN HEAVEN (8) made it two on the trot last start when he got the cash by 5 metres over 1785m at Stawell. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Good enough to take out a race like this. TORQUE INTHEUSA (9) is in good form at present. Finished third at her latest appearance over 2100m at Charlton, beaten 3.5 metres. Meets a comparable field and she can figure in the finish. THEROUX (10) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished 10 metres away in sixth over 1710m at Ballarat. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Meets a similar line up so if he behaves a big run is likely. YANKEE RAIN (4) is worth some thought despite her last-start tenth over 1609m at Cranbourne on September 13.",
